42:32.440 --> 42:36.660
Is how we got into trouble with the Wilmot land with threatening expropriation.

42:38.440 --> 42:42.192
There was never a first report for lands in

42:42.216 --> 42:45.654
Wilmot Township. I recognize

42:45.702 --> 42:49.610
that, but you know, the message coming from the land owners,

42:50.110 --> 42:53.510
okay, was that we were threatening expropriation if

42:53.550 --> 42:57.734
