43:35.080 --> 43:38.840
at about an eighth month period, we'd probably two, three years down

43:38.880 --> 43:42.128
the road, very small amounts of land.

43:42.264 --> 43:46.128
It is the fastest and easiest way. What did I read? 8 parcels

43:46.144 --> 43:49.792
or is there more? There's a significant number

43:49.816 --> 43:54.420
of. Okay, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5. Five parcels.

43:54.920 --> 43:58.800
Seven parcels. Okay. So this is the fastest,

43:58.880 --> 44:02.736
the simplest, and probably the most economic way to do it. I understand

44:02.808 --> 44:06.272
that there was a whole property that you work with the person first and

44:06.296 --> 44:09.740
you negotiate and a last result is expropriation.

44:09.920 --> 44:12.980
But on these slivers of land, whether the people even want

44:13.020 --> 44:16.960
to hire the lawyers or the real estate and go through all that process,

44:17.260 --> 44:20.612
they probably walk up to them and say, here's a good

44:20.636 --> 44:24.132
offer, what do you think? And then you do the deal. If it

44:24.156 --> 44:28.356
was big deals, if it was whole properties, I'd see. I totally back the

44:28.508 --> 44:32.080
council. But these are small slivers of land.

44:33.900 --> 44:36.200
Thank you, councilor. Chair Redmond.

44:38.480 --> 44:40.420
Just going to ask you to call the question.

44:41.680 --> 44:45.256
